#: ../../tools/pmc_tools.rst:32 4aac4057e40746b7ac9ab62e88a2ab16
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search for full-text biomedical literature using the PMC"
" (PubMed Central) API. PMC is the free full-text archive of biomedical "
"and life sciences journal literature at the U.S. National Institutes of "
"Health's National Library of Medicine. Uses \\`limit\\` (default 10); "
"accepts \\`retmax\\` as an alias for \\`limit\\`."
msgstr ""
"**描述**：使用PMC（PubMed "
"Central）API搜索全文生物医学文献。PMC是美国国立卫生研究院国家医学图书馆提供的免费全文生物医学与生命科学期刊文献存档。"

#: ../../tools/pmc_tools.rst:34 27c4df56294c45ff8bf999e011b6d1b9
msgid "**Parameters:**"
msgstr "**参数：**"

#: ../../tools/pmc_tools.rst:36 25c514e857a44e3d9b157224c4e68477
msgid ""
"``query`` (string) (required) Search query for PMC papers. Use keywords "
"separated by spaces to refine your search."
msgstr "``query``（字符串）（必填）用于搜索PMC论文的查询条件。使用空格分隔的关键词以细化搜索结果。"

#: ../../tools/pmc_tools.rst:39 8ee7556dde404a2e8562b9876c625b5b
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``limit`` (integer) (optional) Maximum number of papers to return. This "
"sets the maximum number of papers retrieved from PMC."
msgstr "``limit``（整数）（可选）返回的论文最大数量。此参数设置从PMC检索的论文最大数量。"

#: ../../tools/pmc_tools.rst:42 9629c1bd26e64380b0852e7b95539b63
msgid ""
"``retmax`` (integer) (optional) Alias for limit (NCBI eutils naming). If "
"both retmax and limit are provided, limit is used."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/pmc_tools.rst:45 711d7801428945088b32cfb4f8a0e61d
msgid ""
"``date_from`` (string) (optional) Start date for publication date filter "
"(YYYY/MM/DD format). Optional parameter to limit search to papers "
"published from this date onwards."
msgstr "``date_from``（字符串）（可选）出版日期筛选的起始日期（格式：YYYY/MM/DD）。可选参数，用于限制搜索结果为从该日期起发表的论文。"

#: ../../tools/pmc_tools.rst:48 a89a110d00ea45c2b79b435c574adb23
msgid ""
"``date_to`` (string) (optional) End date for publication date filter "
"(YYYY/MM/DD format). Optional parameter to limit search to papers "
"published up to this date."
msgstr "``date_to``（字符串）（可选）出版日期筛选的结束日期（格式：YYYY/MM/DD）。可选参数，用于限制搜索范围至该日期之前发表的论文。"

#: ../../tools/pmc_tools.rst:51 6f85636f0fca42ed849387e5e6396b3b
msgid ""
"``article_type`` (string) (optional) Article type filter (e.g., "
"'research-article', 'review', 'case-report'). Optional parameter to limit"
" search to specific article types."
msgstr ""
"``article_type``（字符串）（可选）文章类型筛选（例如，'research-article'、'review'、'case-"
"report'）。可选参数，用于限制搜索特定文章类型。"

#: ../../tools/pmc_tools.rst:54 8670ca5176df4ada871fdea663f650df
msgid ""
"``include_abstract`` (boolean) (optional) If true, attempts to enrich "
"results with an abstract (best-effort) by fetching PubMed abstracts for "
"items that have a PMID."
msgstr ""

